{
  "id": "JDG.21",
  "number": "21",
  "bookId": "JDG",
  "reference": "Judges 21",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the Israelites had gathered at Mizpah, they had made a solemn promise to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": “None of us will allow a Benjaminite to marry a daughter of ours.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So now the people of Israel went to Bethel and sat there in the presence of God until evening. Loudly and bitterly they mourned: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " God of Israel, why has this happened? Why is the tribe of Benjamin about to disappear from Israel?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Early the next morning the people built an altar there, offered fellowship sacrifices and burnt some sacrifices whole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They asked, “Is there any group out of all the tribes of Israel that did not go to the gathering in the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s presence at Mizpah?” (They had taken a solemn oath that anyone who had not gone to Mizpah would be put to death.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people of Israel felt sorry for their brothers the Benjaminites and said, “Today Israel has lost one of its tribes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What shall we do to provide wives for the men of Benjamin who are left? We have made a solemn promise to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " that we will not give them any of our daughters.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When they asked if there was some group out of the tribes of Israel that had not gone to the gathering at Mizpah, they found out that no one from Jabesh in Gilead had been there; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "at the roll call of the army no one from Jabesh had responded. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the assembly sent 12,000 of their bravest men with the orders, “Go and kill everyone in Jabesh, including the women and children. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kill all the males, and also every woman who is not a virgin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Among the people in Jabesh they found 400 young virgins, so they brought them to the camp at Shiloh, which is in the land of Canaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the whole assembly sent word to the Benjaminites who were at the Rock of Rimmon and offered to end the war. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Benjaminites came back, and the other Israelites gave them the girls from Jabesh whom they had not killed. But there were not enough of them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The people felt sorry for the Benjaminites because the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " had broken the unity of the tribes of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the leaders of the gathering said, “There are no more women in the tribe of Benjamin. What shall we do to provide wives for the men who are left? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israel must not lose one of its twelve tribes. We must find a way for the tribe of Benjamin to survive, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but we cannot allow them to marry our daughters, because we have put a curse on anyone of us who allows a Benjaminite to marry one of our daughters.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then they thought, “The yearly festival of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " at Shiloh is coming soon.” (Shiloh is north of Bethel, south of Lebonah, and east of the road between Bethel and Shechem.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They said to the Benjaminites, “Go and hide in the vineyards ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and watch. When the young women of Shiloh come out to dance during the festival, you come out of the vineyards. Each of you take a wife by force from among them and take her back to the territory of Benjamin with you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If their fathers or brothers come to you",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21.22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "One ancient translation",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "you",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "us.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and protest, you",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21.22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Probable text",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "you",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "we.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " can say, ‘Please let us keep them, because we did not take them from you in battle to be our wives. And since you did not give them to us, you are not guilty of breaking your promise.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Benjaminites did this; each of them chose a wife from the women who were dancing at Shiloh and carried her away. Then they went back to their own territory, rebuilt their towns, and lived there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At the same time the rest of the Israelites left, and every man went back to his own tribe and family and to his own property.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
